    <TD STYLE="background-color: White; padding: 1pt 3pt; border-right: black 1pt solid; border-bottom: black 1pt solid; text-align: right"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">1,504,560 <SUP>(4)</SUP></FONT></TD>
