<P STYLE="font: italic bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in">Progressively
bridge your fair value determinations to the current value inherent in your proposed transaction. Reconcile and explain (quantifying where
possible) the events and circumstances that caused changes in your fair value estimates to the current implied value of common stock based
on your proposed transaction.</P>

